#### **ENG**
**Preliminary support for 23.0.0**
Support for 23.0.0 is implemented exclusively for emuNAND downgrading. Downgrade emuNAND via kefir-updater to a version below 23.0.0. For everyday use, 23.0.0 is supported only for official firmware.  
How to downgrade - https://youtu.be/CrJJI1XWhDo

**919**
* [**Updated**] [TorrentShopNX 2.12](https://github.com/Langegen/TorrentShopNX/releases/tag/2.12) — Improved catalog updating, downloading and unpacking of large files, added archive browsing as folders and automatic BIOS installation for eight emulator platforms.
* [**Updated**] [Atmosphere 2ae182b](https://github.com/rashevskyv/Kefirosphere) — Atmosphere updated:
    * Integrated official `ro` service fixes from hexkyz (commit `2ae182bd5`):
        * Fixed a critical error when unloading (unmapping) NRO modules from process memory on firmware 23.0.0+: the actual NRO size in the heap is now used for unmapping, preventing address space leaks and freezes when exiting homebrew.
        * Officially integrated upstream fixes for the LZ4 frame decompressor and improved buffer size accounting (PR #2857, #2858, and #2859 closed).
        * Added safe clearing of decompression working buffers in memory after closing a session.
        * Added correct passing and accounting of the BSS section size in the `ParseNro` function.
    * [**Details about changes in the original Atmosphere**](https://github.com/Atmosphere-NX/Atmosphere/commits/master)

**918**
* [**Updated**] [Atmosphere 788546f](https://github.com/rashevskyv/Kefirosphere) — Updated Atmosphere:
    * Firmware 23.0.0 support has been officially merged into the main `master` branch of Atmosphère (the patches we previously implemented have now been accepted upstream).
    * Full decompression of compressed NROs (LZ4 frame format) for HOS 23.0.0+ has been implemented, and bugs in the `ro` module have been fixed (hexkyz commit `58f2b963d`).
    * [PR #2857](https://github.com/Atmosphere-NX/Atmosphere/pull/2857): fixed critical decoding bugs in hexkyz's new LZ4 frame decompressor (header reading, working buffer sizes, and block length accounting).
    * Codebase standardization and safe status handling via `R_DISCARD` have been implemented (hexkyz commit `44d9649c6`).
    * [PR #2852](https://github.com/Atmosphere-NX/Atmosphere/pull/2852): fixed path lengths when renaming files in `htcfs`.
    * [**Details about changes in the original Atmosphere**](https://github.com/Atmosphere-NX/Atmosphere/commits/master)

**917**
* [**Updated**] [Nxthemes Installer nxt-3.0.2](https://github.com/exelix11/SwitchThemeInjector/releases/tag/nxt-3.0.2) — Improved support for hekate boot screen images with automatic rotation of portrait images, added installation of bootscreen themes via the Themezer API, and fixed floating-point number handling.
* [**Updated**] [Atmosphere 2d0fc65](https://github.com/rashevskyv/Kefirosphere) — Updated Atmosphere:
    * Integrated kernel improvements for Horizon OS 23.0.0 support (hexkyz commit `2d0fc65fd`).
    * [PR #2855](https://github.com/Atmosphere-NX/Atmosphere/pull/2855): fixed a crash in the `dmnt:cht` cheat engine when attaching to games on 23.0.0 (thread pointer validation only when they are present).
    * [PR #2854](https://github.com/Atmosphere-NX/Atmosphere/pull/2854): added 16 MB of dynamic heap (stolen heap) to `fs.mitm` for Danganronpa V3 to prevent crashes when loading LayeredFS mods.
    * [PR #2835](https://github.com/Atmosphere-NX/Atmosphere/pull/2835): added support for signed exception header offsets in the `ro` module (fixes NRO loading in Assassin's Creed 3).
    * [**Details about changes in the original Atmosphere (23_support branch)**](https://github.com/Atmosphere-NX/Atmosphere/commits/23_support)
    * [**Details about changes by Alula (23_support branch)**](https://github.com/alula/Atmosphere/commits/23_support) ([PR #2847](https://github.com/Atmosphere-NX/Atmosphere/pull/2847))

